 Request/response examples for external apps are available in the app at `/api-guide` (and FastAPI's `/docs`). Detailed behavior is documented in [CLAUDE.md](claude.md).
 
 - File diff: `GET /api/health`, `POST /api/attachments`, `POST /api/analyze`, `POST /api/convert`, `POST /api/diff`, `POST /api/rediff`, `GET /api/diff/{result_id}`
-- Git diff: `POST /api/git/images`, `POST /api/git/files`, `POST /api/git/markdown` / `GET /api/git/markdown?path=...`, `POST /api/git/item`, `POST /api/git/text-diff`, `POST /api/git/save-text`, `POST /api/git/revert-line`, `POST /api/git/commit`, `POST /api/git/diff`, `POST /api/git/cad-view/jobs`, `POST /api/git/cad-view/model`, `POST /api/git/cad-view/diff`
+- Git diff: `POST /api/git/images`, `POST /api/git/files`, `POST /api/git/markdown` / `GET /api/git/markdown?path=...`, `GET /api/git/path?path=...`, `POST /api/git/item`, `POST /api/git/text-diff`, `POST /api/git/save-text`, `POST /api/git/revert-line`, `POST /api/git/commit`, `POST /api/git/diff`, `POST /api/git/cad-view/jobs`, `POST /api/git/cad-view/model`, `POST /api/git/cad-view/diff`
 - 3D diff: `GET /api/3d/status`, `GET /api/3d/samples`, `POST /api/3d/samples/load`, `POST /api/3d/jobs`, `GET /api/3d/jobs/{job_id}`, `GET /api/3d/jobs/{job_id}/mesh/{side}`, `DELETE /api/3d/jobs/{job_id}`, `POST /api/git/3d/jobs`
 - Settings and reports: `GET /api/settings/obsidian`, `PUT /api/settings/obsidian`, `POST /api/reports/save`
 - Ecosystem (for the opencode harness and the other apps): `GET /api/ecosystem` (app manifest: version, deep links, operations), `POST /api/ecosystem/diff` (compare two local files by path; returns numbers and 3x3 positions only, no images; does not open the browser unless `open_browser` is true)
